+## Generator scripts (`tools/hack/`)
+Each script runs once against the original pret data:
+- `difficulty.py`: gym teams, trainer levels and IVs, AI.
+- `modernize.py <showdown>/data`: split categories, stats, moves and
+  learnsets. It reads Pokémon Showdown's data files as text and never
+  runs them.
+- `encounters.py`: wild placements. It checks that all 386 Pokémon are obtainable.
+- `legendaries.py`: legendary events, flags and the Hall of Fame tickets.
 
